<title>USA: EastGroup Properties sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>EastGroup Properties sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>EastGroup Properties said its board has approved a three-for-two stock split in the form of a share dividend of one share for every two shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The share dividend will be distributed April 7, record March 31.</p>
<p>The trust said it anticipates paying a dividend of $.33 per share for its next regular quarterly dividend in June. The previous annualized dividend rate was $1.3067 after adjusting for the split.</p>
